---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const trips = (await getCollection('trips'))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf())
  .slice(0, 3);
const fmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
---
<Base
  title="Transylvania Fly Fishing: guided fly fishing in the Apuseni Mountains and Bucovina, Romania"
  description="Guided fly fishing for wild brown trout and grayling on the rivers of the Apuseni Mountains and Bucovina, two hours from Cluj-Napoca airport. Catch and release, season 1 April to 30 September."
  current="/"
  hero
>
  <section class="hero">
    <Photo class="hero-photo" src="river4" sizes="100vw" eager />
    <div class="hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-body">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Wild trout and grayling · Romanian Carpathians</div>
      <h1>Wild water, two hours from Cluj airport.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Guided fly fishing on the rivers of the Apuseni Mountains and of Bucovina, with a guide who has fished them all his life. Catch and release, wild fish only.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href={url('/book/')} class="btn btn-light">Book your trip</a>
        <a href={url('/rivers/')} class="btn btn-ghost">See the rivers</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="waterline" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="wave wave-back" viewBox="0 0 2880 60" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 30 C240 0 480 60 720 30 C960 0 1200 60 1440 30 C1680 0 1920 60 2160 30 C2400 0 2640 60 2880 30 V60 H0 Z"></path></svg>
      <svg class="wave wave-front" viewBox="0 0 2880 60" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 30 C240 0 480 60 720 30 C960 0 1200 60 1440 30 C1680 0 1920 60 2160 30 C2400 0 2640 60 2880 30 V60 H0 Z"></path></svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section intro-section">
    <div class="intro">
      <p class="intro-big">Limestone gorges, a mountain lake and wild rivers in the Western Carpathians. Brown trout and grayling, two hours from Cluj.</p>
      <p class="lead">Transylvania Fly Fishing runs guided days and all-inclusive stays out of the Apuseni Nature Park, plus trips to Bucovina in the north. Season {site.season}. Equipment on request. Airport pickup from Cluj-Napoca.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="frame ratio-43"><Photo class="photo" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" src="catch12" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="eyebrow">Guided days</div>
          <h3>A day on the river</h3>
          <p>Walk and wade with Sebi on the stretch that fits the water and your casting. Licence, flies and the photograph included.</p>
          <a href={url('/guiding/')} class="link">Guiding and rates →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="frame ratio-43"><Photo class="photo" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" src="river1" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="eyebrow">All-inclusive stays</div>
          <h3>Two days minimum, everything sorted</h3>
          <p>Lodging by the river, three meals a day, licences, guiding around the clock, dry flies. You get to Cluj; the rest is ours.</p>
          <a href={url('/lodging/')} class="link">Stays and lodging →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="frame ratio-43"><Photo class="photo" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" src="guide12" alt="" /></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="eyebrow">Veterans program</div>
          <h3>For those who serve and served</h3>
          <p>The first program of its kind in Romania, run by a veteran for veterans, retired personnel and their families. Fishing, casting and tying courses, and time to breathe.</p>
          <a href={url('/veterans/')} class="link">About the program →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="head-text">
        <div class="eyebrow">Recent trips</div>
        <h2>From the river, this season.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href={url('/trips/')} class="link">All trips →</a>
    </div>
    <div class:list={['grid-3', { solo: trips.length === 1 }]}>
      {trips.map((t) => (
        <article class="card">
          {t.data.photos[0]
            ? <Photo src={t.data.photos[0]} class="trip-photo" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" />
            : <div class="ph ratio-32" data-caption="photo"></div>}
          <div class="card-body trip-body">
            <div class="trip-meta"><span>{fmt.format(t.data.date)}</span><span>{t.data.river}</span></div>
            <h3 class="trip-title">{t.data.title}</h3>
            <p>{t.body?.slice(0, 160)}</p>
            {t.data.facebook && <a href={t.data.facebook} class="link" rel="noopener">See the post on Facebook →</a>}
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">The water</div>
        <h2 class="h-big">Two regions, one guide.</h2>
        <p class="lead">The Apuseni Mountains hold several trout and grayling rivers within an hour of each other: the Someșul Cald and its Doda Pilii headwaters, the Someșul Rece, the Criș valleys and the Beliș-Fântânele lake. Bucovina, in the northeast, adds the Bistrița Aurie and the Moldova valley for longer trips.</p>
        <div class="rivers">
          <div class="rivers-head">Apuseni</div>
          <div class="rivers-head">Bucovina · Moldova</div>
          <div>Someșul Cald</div><div>Bistrița Aurie</div>
          <div>Doda Pilii headwaters</div><div>Moldova</div>
          <div>Someșul Rece</div><div></div>
          <div>The Criș rivers</div><div></div>
          <div>Beliș-Fântânele lake</div><div></div>
        </div>
        <a href={url('/rivers/')} class="link">River by river, on the map →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="map-card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 440" role="img" aria-label="Schematic map of the two guiding regions in Romania">
          <path d="M60 150 C90 100 150 70 220 60 C300 48 360 70 420 60 C470 52 520 80 560 120 C580 160 570 220 540 260 C520 300 480 330 430 350 C380 372 320 380 260 372 C200 364 140 340 100 300 C60 260 40 200 60 150 Z" fill="none" stroke="#4A535C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 5"></path>
          <g class="rivers-line" fill="none" stroke="#4FB08A" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path pathLength="1" d="M150 212 C170 200 190 196 205 190 C225 182 240 176 255 178" stroke-width="4"></path>
            <path pathLength="1" d="M150 212 C140 222 128 226 118 236" stroke-width="2"></path>
            <path pathLength="1" d="M205 190 C200 176 196 164 194 150" stroke-width="2"></path>
            <path pathLength="1" d="M430 118 C445 132 452 150 462 166 C470 180 480 192 486 206" stroke-width="3.5"></path>
            <path pathLength="1" d="M400 150 C420 160 440 176 458 190" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
            <path pathLength="1" d="M486 206 C500 214 516 218 530 226" stroke-width="2"></path>
          </g>
          <g class="flow" fill="none" stroke="#E4F7EE" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M150 212 C170 200 190 196 205 190 C225 182 240 176 255 178"></path>
            <path d="M150 212 C140 222 128 226 118 236"></path>
            <path d="M205 190 C200 176 196 164 194 150"></path>
            <path d="M430 118 C445 132 452 150 462 166 C470 180 480 192 486 206"></path>
            <path d="M400 150 C420 160 440 176 458 190"></path>
            <path d="M486 206 C500 214 516 218 530 226"></path>
          </g>
          <ellipse cx="262" cy="182" rx="14" ry="6" fill="#4FB08A" opacity=".55"></ellipse>
          <circle class="pulse" cx="300" cy="230" r="4" fill="none" stroke="#F5F2EC" stroke-width="1"></circle>
          <g fill="#F5F2EC"><circle cx="300" cy="230" r="4"></circle><circle cx="150" cy="212" r="3.5"></circle><circle cx="430" cy="118" r="3.5"></circle></g>
          <g font-family="Instrument Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#B5BEC7">
            <text x="310" y="234">Cluj-Napoca</text><text x="120" y="256">Doda Pilii</text><text x="438" y="112">Câmpulung Moldovenesc</text><text x="270" y="200">Beliș lake</text>
          </g>
          <g font-family="Cormorant Garamond, Georgia, serif" font-size="16" font-style="italic" fill="#F5F2EC">
            <text x="176" y="176">Someșul Cald</text><text x="470" y="176">Bistrița Aurie</text><text x="392" y="146">Moldova</text>
          </g>
          <g font-family="Instrument Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="11" letter-spacing="1.5" fill="#7A828B"><text x="120" y="290">APUSENI</text><text x="470" y="240">BUCOVINA</text></g>
          <text x="20" y="428" font-family="ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#7A828B" letter-spacing="1">SCHEMATIC · NOT TO SCALE</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="portrait"><div class="frame ratio-45"><Photo class="photo" src="guide18" alt="Sebastian Budeanu" /></div></div>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Your guide</div>
        <h2 class="h-big">Sebastian Budeanu. Sebi, on the river.</h2>
        <p class="bio">He learned to fish on a hazel rod with his grandfather on a river in the north of the country, and learned why the fish goes back. Twenty-seven years in the Romanian Army, serving alongside American, British and Italian units, taught him the rest: trust, camaraderie, and how to look after people outdoors.</p>
        <p class="bio">Today he guides on the rivers of the Apuseni and in Bucovina, teaches children and beginners every summer, and runs Romania's only fly fishing program for veterans. Come as a guest, leave as a friend.</p>
        <a href={url('/guiding/')} class="link">How a guided day works →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta contours">
    <div class="rings" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="wrap cta-body">
      <div class="stack">
        <h2 class="cta-title">Season runs {site.season}.</h2>
        <p class="cta-lead">Send your dates and group size. Sebi replies personally with availability and a plan, usually within two days.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href={url('/book/')} class="btn btn-cta">Book your trip</a>
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="btn btn-ghost">{site.email}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; min-height: min(100svh, 940px); display: flex; align-items: flex-end; background: var(--dark); color: var(--on-dark); overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-photo { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; animation: settle 16s var(--ease) both; }
  @keyframes settle { from { transform: scale(1.14); } to { transform: none; } }
  .hero-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 30, 27, .4) 0%, rgba(20, 30, 27, .18) 26%, rgba(20, 30, 27, .58) 56%, rgba(20, 30, 27, .92) 100%), radial-gradient(120% 80% at 0% 100%, rgba(20, 30, 27, .55), transparent 60%); }
  .hero-body { position: relative; width: 100%; padding-top: 160px; padding-bottom: clamp(96px, 12vw, 150px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
  .hero-body > * { animation: rise 1s var(--ease) both; }
  .hero-body > :nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .15s; }
  .hero-body > :nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .3s; }
  .hero-body > :nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .5s; }
  .hero-body > :nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .68s; }
  .hero-eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #CFE7DA; }
  .hero-eyebrow::before { content: ''; flex: 0 0 36px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(44px, 7.6vw, 112px); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.02em; max-width: 13ch; text-shadow: 0 2px 40px rgba(12, 20, 17, .45); }
  .hero-lead { font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 18px); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 52ch; color: var(--line); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }

  /* The bottom edge of the hero is a slow-moving water line that dissolves into the page. */
  .waterline { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: -1px; height: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 60px); overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
  .wave { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; height: 100%; fill: var(--bg); }
  .wave-front { width: 200%; animation: wave-front 26s linear infinite; }
  .wave-back { width: 300%; opacity: .38; animation: wave-back 19s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes wave-front { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  @keyframes wave-back { from { transform: translateX(-25%); } to { transform: none; } }

  .intro-section { padding-top: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); }

  .intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr)); gap: 40px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px); }
  .intro-big { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); line-height: 1.2; }
  .intro .lead { max-width: 46ch; }


  .trip-photo { aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  /* A single trip reads as a feature: photo beside the note instead of one very wide card. */
  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .solo .card { flex-direction: row; align-items: stretch; }
    .solo .trip-photo { width: 56%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
    .solo .trip-body { justify-content: center; padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px); gap: 14px; }
    .solo .trip-body p { flex: 0 1 auto; font-size: 16px; }
    .solo .trip-title { font-size: clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 44px); }
  }
  .trip-body { padding: 20px 22px 24px; gap: 8px; }
  .trip-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .trip-title { font-size: 26px; }
  .trip-body p { font-size: 14px; }

  .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .h-big { font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 60px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .bio { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .rivers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  .rivers > div { padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .rivers-head { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 0 !important; }
  .map-card { background: var(--dark); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  /* Rivers draw themselves in when the map scrolls into view, then water keeps moving along them. */
  .map-card[data-reveal] .rivers-line path { stroke-dasharray: 1; stroke-dashoffset: 1; transition: stroke-dashoffset 2.4s var(--ease) .35s; }
  .map-card[data-reveal].is-in .rivers-line path { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  .flow path { stroke-dasharray: 2 17; opacity: .85; animation: flow 2.6s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes flow { to { stroke-dashoffset: -19; } }
  .pulse { transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; animation: pulse 3s ease-out infinite; }
  @keyframes pulse { from { transform: scale(1); opacity: .9; } to { transform: scale(4.5); opacity: 0; } }

  .portrait { position: relative; isolation: isolate; }
  .portrait::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 14px -14px -14px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius); opacity: .55; z-index: -1; }
  .map-card svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

  .cta { position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin-top: var(--section); background-color: var(--dark); color: var(--on-dark); }
  .cta-body { position: relative; }
  /* The dark call to action runs straight into the footer on this page. */
  :global(body.has-hero .site-footer) { margin-top: 0; }
  :global(body.has-hero .foot-rule) { display: none; }
  /* Rise rings: the surface of the water where a trout has just taken a fly. */
  .rings { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .rings i { position: absolute; width: 260px; height: 260px; margin: -130px; transform: scaleY(.3); }
  .rings i::before, .rings i::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 1.5px solid var(--accent-on-dark); border-radius: 50%; opacity: 0; animation: ring 7s ease-out infinite; animation-delay: inherit; }
  .rings i::after { inset: 18%; }
  .rings i:nth-child(1) { left: 74%; top: 28%; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .rings i:nth-child(2) { left: 90%; top: 76%; width: 180px; height: 180px; margin: -90px; animation-delay: 2.6s; }
  .rings i:nth-child(3) { left: 52%; top: 88%; width: 200px; height: 200px; margin: -100px; animation-delay: 4.4s; }
  @keyframes ring { 0% { transform: scale(.04); opacity: 0; } 12% { opacity: .5; } 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0; } }
  .cta-body { padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr)); gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
  .cta .stack { gap: 14px; }
  .cta-title { font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 54px); line-height: 1.05; }
  .cta-lead { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--on-dark-2); max-width: 48ch; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
  .btn-cta { background: var(--accent-on-dark); color: #12261C; }
  .btn-cta:hover { background: #63BE9A; color: #12261C; }
</style>
